* ASTRAN Technology Rules: SkyWater sky130A (hand-written, see pdks/sky130/README.md)
* Astran layer -> sky130 layer: MET1 = li1, VIA1 = mcon, MET2 = met1, VIA2 = via, MET3 = met2,
* CONT = licon1. So an 'M1' rule below holds an li1 value, 'CT' holds licon, 'VI' holds mcon, 'M2' holds met1.
* Where sky130 has several conditional rules for one Astran rule, the conservative value is used.
* Values cross-checked against libs.tech/magic/sky130A.tech.

TECHNAME	sky130A
MINSTEP		0.005
MLAYERS		3

